68
00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:12.830
I love you, ladies.

69
00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.320
I so agree.

70
00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:16.960
Right?

71
00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.000
I so agree.

72
