00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:50.540
And then we won.

242
00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.180
And I'm like walking to the stage.

243
00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.400
And I'm like, oh, my God.

244
00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:56.380
Well, I know you guys are tired of me talking about being pregnant.

