00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:34.720
All right.

260
00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.200
Fast fact number three.

261
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.220
This episode is a baby shower.

262
00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.780
So I'm going to tell you some stuff about baby showers.

263
00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.000
You did a deep dive on baby showers?

264
00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:43.400
I did.

265
00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:44.720
What is there to know?

266
00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:45.780
It's a baby coming.

267
00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:47.080
Get some presents.

268
00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.100
Get everyone ready.

269
00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.400
What else is there to know?

270
00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:54.880
Well, baby showers are believed to date all the way back to the Egyptian and Greek civilizations.

271
00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:55.920
Whoa!

272
00:12:55.920 --> 00:13:02.000
But baby showers as we know them today began during the baby boom era of World War II.

273
00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:11.840
So traditionally, the baby shower was thrown by a close family member or a friend, and the mother-to-be opened gifts in a decorated chair.

274
00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.160
Well, Jan has a very decorated chair.

275
00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.180
I noticed.

276
00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:15.840
Yeah.

277
00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.300
Thank you, party planning committee.

278
00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.700
Thank you, Phyllis.

279
00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:22.500
Well, I think Angela did it because Phyllis is making her do everything.

280
00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.980
So thank you, Angela.

281
00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:24.860
Okay.

282
00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.360
I don't know.

283
00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.420
Well, listen.

284
00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:31.340
Nowadays, we have all kinds of ways that we can celebrate a new baby.

285
00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:35.040
And here are some new updated baby showers.

286
00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:36.840
A diaper shower.

287
00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:40.920
That's where all you bring are diapers in different sizes.

288
00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:46.460
It's like if you go to your baby shower, it's like you went to Costco and bought out all the diapers.

289
00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:49.620
You just go home with every diaper because diapers are expensive.

290
00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:50.920
What's the next one?

291
00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:52.420
Grandparents shower.

292
00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:53.180
Hmm?

293
00:13:53.840 --> 00:14:01.480
This is a shower that you throw for the grandparents, and you give them stuff to keep at their house for when the baby comes over.

294
00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:03.300
Boo.

295
00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.300
I love you, grandparents, but come on.

296
00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.600
Grandparents, they love to go get that stuff.

297
00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:11.700
Yeah, I don't know.

298
00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.080
Here's another one.

299
00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:13.380
Okay.

300
00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.320
I've heard of these.

301
00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.040
A sprinkle.

302
00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.040
What?

303
00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.500
You don't have a baby shower.

304
00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:18.520
You have a sprinkle.

305
00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.640
It sounds like you're going pee.

306
00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:20.440
It does.

307
00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:31.400
This is a shower that you throw for your second or third or fourth babies to collect maybe some of the things if you are having a baby of a different gender.

308
00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:32.240
Right, right.

309
00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:33.780
Or if you need to refresh.

310
00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:34.440
Oh, my God.

311
00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:35.340
I just got it.

312
00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:37.280
A shower and a sprinkle.

313
00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:37.740
Yeah.

314
00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:38.900
It's not a full shower.

315
00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.140
It's just a sprinkle.

316
00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.460
Every time you say it, I just think of tinkling.

317
00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:43.580
I do, too.

318
00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:44.780
All right.

319
00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.680
The final one is a sip and see.

