321
00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.520
It does.

322
00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:55.060
It is a celebration planned by the new parents after the baby has arrived.

323
00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.660
Oh, you sip and you get to see the baby.

324
00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.100
Yes.

