00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:03.400
So I have to say what we are going to see in this episode is technically a sip and see.

326
00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:04.360
You know what?

327
00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.980
I have been to a sip and see, but I didn't even know it.

328
00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.040
I love the name sip and see.

329
00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:09.880
Sip and see.

330
00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.960
Can I have a sip and see for my new puppy?

331
00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:15.400
Can I do that?

332
00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.020
Yes.

333
00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:16.900
Okay, good.

334
00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.860
That's all I got, Ange.

335
00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:19.800
Anything you want to add?

336
00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.200
Do you have a Kinsey tidbit today?

337
00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.960
Well, here's a little Kinsey tidbit.

