00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:28.080
One of the things Erin said, which we have talked about before, is how long these scripts came in.

339
00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:35.380
You know, they were pretty big episodes and then we would have to just chisel away and there was so much that didn't make it to the screen.

