00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:50.510
I am an ER doctor and whenever I'm teaching medical students how to deliver a baby, I like to show them the cold open from this episode.

428
00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:51.350
Get out.

429
00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:51.970
Yes.

