00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:52.370
was kind of like a little mini reception and he had bowls of M&Ms that said Jim and Pam.

497
00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:54.350
He clearly was a big fan.

498
00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:56.670
He loved that you could personalize an M&M.

499
00:22:56.690 --> 00:22:57.050
I know.

