Michael says, why didn't you call me?

724
00:32:48.350 --> 00:32:49.230
I could have helped.

725
00:32:49.510 --> 00:32:53.390
Jan said, well, the birth instructor thought it wasn't a good idea for you to be there.

726
00:32:53.390 --> 00:33:00.850
So Michael says, oh man, him, that guy, he had no sense of humor and I proved him wrong

727
00:33:00.850 --> 00:33:02.230
in so many ways.

728
00:33:02.630 --> 00:33:05.270
And it just made me think about these classes.

729
00:33:05.510 --> 00:33:11.230
I wish we could have seen Michael trying to do comedy bits with like a birthing instructor.

730
00:33:11.630 --> 00:33:13.430
I would have loved to seen that scene.

731
00:33:13.650 --> 00:33:16.730
I think what Jan has done to Michael is so cruel.

732
00:33:16.730 --> 00:33:19.510
I know that she didn't call him.

733
00:33:19.510 --> 00:33:24.090
And also in that scene, Jan is like, Michael, you don't know what I have been through.

734
00:33:24.190 --> 00:33:26.410
And he said, no, no, I don't.

735
00:33:26.710 --> 00:33:28.930
And I love Steve's delivery on that.

736
00:33:29.030 --> 00:33:29.430
I know.

737
00:33:29.710 --> 00:33:33.470
I guess she feels bad and she lets him hold the baby, but it says the baby has to stay

738
00:33:33.470 --> 00:33:34.250
in the car seat.

739
00:33:34.610 --> 00:33:39.710
And then Michael has this very sweet talking head where he says he loves babies and he

740
00:33:39.710 --> 00:33:41.770
tries to pick them up and hold one every day.

741
00:33:41.950 --> 00:33:43.350
It just nourishes him.

742
00:33:43.890 --> 00:33:48.930
And then we see this really sweet montage of Michael and babies and the babies love him.

743
00:33:48.930 --> 00:33:49.890
They really do.

744
00:33:50.250 --> 00:33:53.730
Well, that's because it's Steve Carell is holding the babies.

745
00:33:53.970 --> 00:33:58.050
I mean, not to say that they wouldn't have loved Michael, but Steve is a natural with

746
00:33:58.050 --> 00:33:58.390
kids.

747
00:33:58.530 --> 00:33:58.930
I know.

748
00:33:59.330 --> 00:34:01.230
We had a fan question from Evan L.

749
00:34:01.350 --> 00:34:02.390
and Stacey M.

750
00:34:02.590 --> 00:34:07.490
